From af65f2a632d2f87ab3097dd305ffa47b918e85cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yibo Wang <2024312277@stu.hit.edu.cn>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 05:58:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: iceland camera bring-up: Kaanapali CAMSS +
 SmartSens SC sensors

CAMSS: Kaanapali (SM8850) support - CSID gen4, VFE gen4 on TFE
blocks, CSIPHY v2.4.0 handling, SoC DT node in kaanapali.dtsi and
the qcom,kaanapali-camss dt-binding.

iceland: enable CAMSS and QUP SE9 I2C; wire rear SC1300CS
(camera@36, CSIPHY4) and front SC820CS (camera@10, CSIPHY5) -
supplies L14B/L1F/L2F (+L16B AF, rear), reset on PMH0110-G
gpio14/13, 19.2 MHz RPMh DIV_CLK1 MCLK on PMK8850 gpio2/gpio1
func2.

smartsens-sc: new SC1300CS/SC820CS driver; chip ID at
0x3107/0x3108 is 0xc658/0xd154 per the vendor DT.

Compile-tested with the project build config.
